2. Implemented all the necessary functionality directly in the component:
   - Date range selection
   - Preset options
   - UI components from @calcom/ui
3. Used local state instead of context
4. Removed all dependencies on DataTableProvider and its hooks
5. Kept the same UI and functionality but with simplified implementation

This approach should work better because:
